## 🚀 Overview

A **production-ready backend system** built using **Node.js & Express**, designed to handle authentication, media uploads, and structured music management.

Built with a focus on scalability ⚡, clean architecture 🧠, and real-world backend practices 🏗️.

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

**Node.js** • **Express** • **MongoDB** • **Mongoose** • **JWT** • **Multer**

---

## 🔥 Features

* ✨ **Secure JWT Authentication** (Cookie-based)
* 👤 **Role-based Access Control** (Artist / User)
* 🎧 **Upload & Manage Music Files**
* 💿 **Album Creation & Linking**
* ☁️ **Cloud Storage Integration** via Service Layer
* ⚡ **Clean MVC Architecture**

---

